# This project currently has no backend — all content lives in src/data/.
# The variables below are only needed once you connect Supabase (see the
# "Connecting a real backend" section in README.md). Until then, this file
# can stay empty; nothing in the code reads these yet.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project.supabase.co"
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-anon-public-key"
# Never put your service_role key in a VITE_ variable — anything prefixed
# VITE_ is bundled into the browser JS and is publicly visible.
